This project is the on-car (native QNX) layer of a two-layer product. It reads its
signal catalog from the companion project nbtevo-diag (Apache-2.0) and shares its decode
definitions with it by code generation (codegen/gen_dids.py), so there is a single source
of truth and no drift between the Python reader and the C collector.

